    "coreTexts": {
      "zh-CN": "连点或长按后，可琳使用电锯持续斩击敌人时，招式造成的伤害提升37.5%。"
    },
    "additionalAbilityTexts": {
      "zh-CN": "队伍中存在与自身属性或阵营相同的角色时触发：\n可琳攻击命中处于失衡状态下的敌人时，自身造成的伤害提升35%。"
    },
    "cinemaTexts": [
      {
        "en": "When Corin's Chain Attack or Ultimate hits an enemy, her DMG against the target increases by 12% for 15s.",
        "zh-CN": "[连携技]或[终结技]命中敌人时，可琳对目标造成的伤害提升12%，持续15秒。"
      },
      {
        "en": "When Corin's EX Special Attack, Chain Attack or Ultimate hits an enemy, the target's Physical RES is reduced by 0.5%, stacking up to 20 times and lasting 5s. The duration of each stack is calculated separately.",
        "zh-CN": "[强化特殊技]、[连携技]或[终结技]命中敌人时，目标的物理伤害抗性下降0.5%，最多叠加20层，持续5秒，每层效果单独结算持续时间。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Basic Attack, Dodge, Assist, Special Attack, and Chain Attack Lv. +2",
        "zh-CN": "[普通攻击]、[闪避]、[支援技]、[特殊技]、[连携技] 技能等级+2"
      },
      {
        "en": "When Corin uses a Quick Assist, Defensive Assist, or Chain Attack, she recovers 7.2 Energy. This effect can trigger once every 16s.",
        "zh-CN": "发动[快速支援]、[招架支援]或[连携技]时，可琳回复7.2点能量，16秒内最多触发一次。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Basic Attack, Dodge, Assist, Special Attack, and Chain Attack Lv. +2",
        "zh-CN": "[普通攻击]、[闪避]、[支援技]、[特殊技]、[连携技] 技能等级+2"
      },
      {
        "en": "When Corin's extended slash hits an enemy, she obtains a stack of Charge (max 40 stacks).\nDuring a Dodge Counter, Special Attack, EX Special Attack, Quick Assist, or Assist Follow-Up, when her chainsaw detonation hits an enemy, consumes all stacks of Charge. Each stack consumed causes the attack to deal an additional 3% of ATK as DMG.",
        "zh-CN": "持续斩击命中敌人时，可琳获得1层充能（最多40层）；在[闪避反击]、[特殊技]、[强化特殊技]、[快速支援]、[支援突击]中，引爆电锯命中敌人时，消耗所有充能，每层充能使本次攻击额外造成可琳3%攻击力的伤害。"
      }
    ]
  }
